OL,3,GNEWSAParty leader apologises for
OL,4,Awearing headphones during debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FUlster Unionist leader Jon Burrows has
OL,7,Fapologised for wearing wireless
OL,8,Fheadphones in the assembly chamber
OL,9,Fduring Monday's no-confidence motions
OL,10,Fin four Sinn Fein ministers.
OL,12,FFollowing the debate, Speaker Edwin
OL,13,FPoots said it had come to his attention
OL,14,Fthat an MLA (Member of the Legislative
OL,15,FAssembly) had been wearing AirPods and
OL,16,Fsaid he would be writing to them as a
OL,17,Freminder of what is acceptable conduct
OL,18,Fin the chamber.
OL,20,FPoots has previously had to warn MLAs
OL,21,Fover their language in the chamber and
OL,22,Ftheir dress code.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
